<h3>&nbsp;About Anatomy &amp; Physiology I &amp; II</h3>

<p><strong>Anatomy &amp; Physiology I &amp; II&nbsp;</strong>contains a database of microscopic images that cover the slides typically seen in <strong>Anatomy and Physiology I &amp; II</strong> courses. These can also be used in <strong>General Biology I &amp; II</strong>, as well as a <strong>Biology and the Human Body</strong> course. The completed project will consist of 152 slides with 10 images of each displaying&nbsp;&nbsp;multiple magnification strengths.&nbsp;Also included are lab power points as well as ADA compliant videos and images. The oveall goal is to&nbsp;aid students in the comprehension of cellular,&nbsp;as well as, gross anatomy.&nbsp;</p>

